[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 10983.51, "timestamp": "03:03:03", "text": "哦，你去拿手枪了。 哦，谢谢。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10985.349, "timestamp": "03:03:05", "text": "那张头像照拍得真不错。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10987.67, "timestamp": "03:03:07", "text": "是的，我根本没想过会"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10989.429, "timestamp": "03:03:09", "text": "发生这种事。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10991.269, "timestamp": "03:03:11", "text": "我的天啊。 还有一种情况我讨厌"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10994.71, "timestamp": "03:03:14", "text": "。 我讨厌这个。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10996.87, "timestamp": "03:03:16", "text": "这就好比你给这些枪都装备上，然后就"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10998.71, "timestamp": "03:03:18", "text": "变成了谁先击中谁，你"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11001.11, "timestamp": "03:03:21", "text": "知道吗？ 唉，没有第二次"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11018.07, "timestamp": "03:03:38", "text": "你比我昨天玩的恐怖游戏还吓人"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11019.59, "timestamp": "03:03:39", "text": "。 实话实说"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11031.429, "timestamp": "03:03:51", "text": "我知道。 你现在是不是在催我喝茶"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11035.11, "timestamp": "03:03:55", "text": "？ 哦，不。 什么？ 发生了什么？ 你"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11036.63, "timestamp": "03:03:56", "text": "刚才是在嘲讽我，对吧"}]